# Context for web.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this instead of the root
# .dockerignore, which is shaped for the API image): the two Vite apps and the
# build script that turns them into the two screens and the Caddyfile,
# nothing else.
*
!apps/branding/auth-ui/
!apps/central/admin/
!packages/ui/
!packages/contract/schema.d.ts
!deploy/onprem/Caddyfile
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
packages/ui/login/
packages/ui/console/
**/coverage/
# A developer's or a deploy script's build settings (VITE_API_URL pointing at
# some other deployment) must not reach this build.
**/.env*
